      "path": "src/itg/relocated/e2e-d7/runtime-failure.ts",
      "content": "`detail.anywhere` does not exist on the imported helper: `e2e/d7/support.ts` re-exports the `detail` object from `e2e/support/detail/index.ts`, which has no `anywhere` member (nor do its spread modules define one). This introduces a TypeScript error and, if executed without typechecking, a `TypeError` before the assertions run. The same issue affects the new calls in all five reviewed files. Add and export the intended synchronous locator-scope helper before migrating these callers, or use the existing supported helpers.",
